    summary_60s: 'Pollution is the unwanted presence of harmful substances or disturbances in the environment. It damages health, ecosystems, and overall quality of life. It can be the smog in our cities, waste in our waterways, or noise that disrupts our peace. Environmental pollution is the cont',
